    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah but \"fundamental rights\" sound a bit abstract. like, if we have the tech to stop a terrorist attack or find a missing kid in a station in real time, isn't it kind of irresponsible NOT to use it? isn't the risk of harm in NOT using it way higher than the risk of losing some privacy?",
